Let me write the solution script.

```
edit 1:20
buf = b"BgApYb7nCswD"
flag = ""
for i in range(12):
    if (i & 1) == 0 and i != 0:
        c = buf[i]
        bits = [(c << k) >> 7 & 1 for k in range(8)]
        for j in range(4):
            if bits[j] == bits[j+4]:
                flag += "0"
            else:
                flag += "1"
print(flag)
end_of_edit
```

