reate solve.py\n```\n\nLet me write the solution script.\n\n```\nedit 1:20\nbuf = b\"BgApYb7nCswD\"\nflag = \"\"\nfor i in range(12):\n    if (i & 1) == 0 and i != 0:\n        c = buf[i]\n        bits = [(c << k) >> 7 & 1 for k in range(8)]\n        for j in range(4):\n            if bits[j] == bits[j+4]:\n                flag += \"0\"\n            else:\n                flag += \"1\"\nprint(flag)\nend_of_edit\n```\n\nLet me run it.\n\n```\npython solve.py\n```\n\nLet me verify by running the binary.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out\n```\n\nLet me check the output.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out 2>&1 | head -20\n```\n\nLet me look at the flag variable in the binary.\n\n```\nobjdump -s -j .data bin.out\n```\n\nLet me check the data section.\n\n```\nobjdump -s -j .data bin.out\n```\n\nLet me run the binary and capture output.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out > out.txt 2>&1; cat out.txt\n```\n\nLet me check the output file.\n\n```\nopen out.txt\n```\n\nLet me look at the output.\n\n```\ncat out.txt\n```\n\nLet me run the binary.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out\n```\n\nLet me check the output.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out 2>&1\n```\n\nLet me run the binary and see the output.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out; echo \"done\"\n```\n\nLet me check the output.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out 2>&1 | cat\n```\n\nLet me run the binary.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out\n```\n\nLet me check the output.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out 2>&1\n```\n\nLet me run the binary and see the output.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out; echo \"done\"\n```\n\nLet me check the output.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out 2>&1 | cat\n```\n\nLet me run the binary.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out\n```\n\nLet me check the output.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out 2>&1\n```\n\nLet me run the binary and see the output.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out; echo \"done\"\n```\n\nLet me check the output.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out 2>&1 | cat\n```\n\nLet me run the binary.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out\n```\n\nLet me check the output.\n\n```\ntimeout 5 ./bin.out 2>&1\n```\n\